Z||000015||SpeedPhreak||02-18-2000||10:56 AM||||more cool stuff...<P>if u can find a metal tennis ball can... wrap it in duck tape, punch a hole about 3/8 to 1/2 inch above the bottom... fill it w/gasoline to the level of the hole... insert a piece of green wick (at gun stores)... soak a tennis ball in gas & put it in... secure the can to something & light the fuse... great balls of fire.||||reg||10
