Z||000020||fierospeeder||02-19-2000||10:33 PM||||All i did when i was a kid with a friend was two liter soda bottles with the Works toilet bowl cleaner, which is just hydrochloric acid, and aluminum foil in pieces.  Put them together close the cap and shake it up.  After a few minutes, a reaction happens and gas is produced, eventually the bottle explodes.<P>I heard if you take a wire thats hot,using a switch to turn it on, and put it near the exhaust you can make flames.  ||||reg||1
